# Blocks Agent, Tab, Inline Edit and @-mentions. Does NOT block terminal or MCP
# tools - a shell command can still reach these paths. Cursor already honours
# .gitignore on top of this list.

# Godot's generated import cache. 7.9 MB, ~500 files, zero signal.
.godot/

# Generated per-asset metadata and script UIDs.
*.import
*.uid

# Binary media. The agent cannot read these usefully and they are 8 MB of the repo.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.ctex
*.md5
*.wav
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.sample

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.translation
export_presets.cfg
